{
  "name": "Partial refunds for orders",
  "description": "# Context\n\nSupport asks to refund single order lines rather than whole orders (refunds spec, R1–R3), and finance wants the legacy credit note flow gone (finance notes).\n\n# Decisions\n\n## D1. A refund is an aggregate of its own\n\n[Refund](noesis:building_block|sales.refunds.Refund), in a new refunds module, records the lines given back; [Refund.issue](noesis:behavior|sales.refunds.Refund.issue) announces it with [RefundIssued](noesis:building_block|sales.refunds.RefundIssued).\n\n- **Why:** a refund has a lifecycle of its own (R2), and keeping it out of the order keeps the order aggregate small.\n- **Trade-off:** the order learns of a refund through the event, not in the same transaction.\n\n## D2. The order only records which lines were refunded\n\n[Order](noesis:building_block|sales.orders.Order) gains the refunded lines and nothing else (R3).\n\n## D3. Credit notes are retired\n\n[CreditNote](noesis:building_block|sales.credit-notes.CreditNote) and its issue behaviour are removed; refunds replace them (finance notes).\n\n# Left out and open\n\n- Partial refunds of a single line's quantity: a later change.",
  "needs": {
    "added": [
      {
        "id": "refund-single-lines",
        "name": {
          "value": "Refund single lines"
        },
        "stakeholder": {
          "value": "Support agents"
        },
        "statement": {
          "value": "Support agents need to refund one line of an order when the customer returns only part of it, without cancelling the whole order."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "modules": {
    "added": [
      {
        "id": "module|sales.refunds",
        "name": {
          "value": "refunds"
        },
        "definition": {
          "value": "Everything about giving money back to a customer."
        },
        "rules": {
          "added": [
            {
              "name": "A refund is issued within a second",
              "category": {
                "value": "Quality"
              },
              "ruleType": {
                "value": "Performance"
              },
              "description": {
                "value": "Issuing a refund answers within one second for an order of up to 100 lines."
              },
              "needs": {
                "value": ["refund-single-lines"]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "removed": ["module|sales.credit-notes"],
    "modified": [
      {
        "id": "module|sales.orders",
        "definition": {
          "value": "Order lifecycle, now including the refundable state of each line.",
          "author": "human"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "buildingBlocks": {
    "added": [
